  "version": 1,
  "title": "Schauder bases in unitary orbits",
  "abstract": "A Lean 4 formalization of the following theorem: a strongly continuous one-parameter group of unitary operators on a separable infinite-dimensional complex Hilbert space has simple continuous spectrum if and only if one of its orbits contains a Schauder basis, that is, there are a vector g and pairwise distinct real numbers t_n such that (U_{t_n} g) is a Schauder basis.",
